Cell["\<\
Only basis algebraic operations are supported for noncommutative fields. Most \
of commands only work if coefficients are in domain \[DoubleStruckCapitalR] \
or \[DoubleStruckCapitalC]. A coefficient\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]  is not a mathematical \
field (it may have zero divisors).\
\>", "Notes",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953651088346464*^9, 3.953651090908451*^9}, {
  3.9536511807070236`*^9, 3.9536511818587666`*^9}, {3.954599876555077*^9, 
